IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. UICALC.
AUTHOR. SYNTHETIC SAMPLE.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT CLAIM-FILE ASSIGN TO KEYBOARD
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
    SELECT RESULT-FILE ASSIGN TO DISPLAY
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD  CLAIM-FILE
    RECORD IS VARYING IN SIZE FROM 1 TO 512
        DEPENDING ON WS-IN-LEN.
01  CLAIM-LINE                  PIC X(512).

FD  RESULT-FILE.
01  RESULT-LINE                 PIC X(40).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-IN-LEN                   PIC 9(4) COMP.
01  WS-EOF                      PIC X VALUE "N".
    88  AT-END-OF-CLAIMS        VALUE "Y".

01  CLAIM-REC.
    05  CL-ID                   PIC X(9).
    05  CL-Q1-X                 PIC X(9).
    05  CL-Q1 REDEFINES CL-Q1-X PIC 9(7)V99.
    05  CL-Q2-X                 PIC X(9).
    05  CL-Q2 REDEFINES CL-Q2-X PIC 9(7)V99.
    05  CL-Q3-X                 PIC X(9).
    05  CL-Q3 REDEFINES CL-Q3-X PIC 9(7)V99.
    05  CL-Q4-X                 PIC X(9).
    05  CL-Q4 REDEFINES CL-Q4-X PIC 9(7)V99.
    05  CL-DEP-X                PIC X(2).
    05  CL-DEP REDEFINES CL-DEP-X PIC 9(2).
    05  CL-AGE-X                PIC X(2).
    05  CL-AGE REDEFINES CL-AGE-X PIC 9(2).
    05  CL-RET                  PIC X.
    05  CL-PEN-X                PIC X(7).
    05  CL-PEN REDEFINES CL-PEN-X PIC 9(5)V99.
    05  CL-SEV-X                PIC X(7).
    05  CL-SEV REDEFINES CL-SEV-X PIC 9(5)V99.
    05  CL-FLAG                 PIC X.
    05  CL-FILLER               PIC X(15).

01  RESULT-REC.
    05  RS-STATUS               PIC 9(2).
    05  RS-BASE                 PIC 9(5)V99.
    05  RS-ALLOW                PIC 9(5)V99.
    05  RS-OFFSET               PIC 9(5)V99.
    05  RS-NET                  PIC 9(5)V99.
    05  RS-TRACE                PIC X(10).

01  WS-TRACE                    PIC X(10).
01  WS-STATUS                   PIC 9(2).
01  WS-VALID                    PIC X.
    88  RECORD-IS-VALID         VALUE "Y".

01  WS-Q4-USED                  PIC 9(7)V99.
01  WS-TOTAL                    PIC 9(8)V99 COMP-3.
01  WS-HIGH                     PIC 9(7)V99 COMP-3.
01  WS-QUARTERS                 PIC 9.
01  WS-QUOTIENT                 PIC 9(3).
01  WS-BASE                     PIC 9(5)V99.
01  WS-ALLOW                    PIC 9(5)V99.
01  WS-DEPS-USED                PIC 9(2).
01  WS-COMBINED                 PIC 9(5)V99.
01  WS-CEILING                  PIC 9(7)V99.
01  WS-OFFSET                   PIC 9(5)V99.
01  WS-NET                      PIC 9(5)V99.

01  CAP-BASE                    PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 650.00.
01  MIN-WAGES                   PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 2500.00.
01  ALLOW-PER-DEP               PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 25.00.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    OPEN INPUT CLAIM-FILE
    OPEN OUTPUT RESULT-FILE
    PERFORM 1000-READ-CLAIM
    PERFORM UNTIL AT-END-OF-CLAIMS
        PERFORM 2000-PROCESS-CLAIM
        PERFORM 1000-READ-CLAIM
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE CLAIM-FILE
    CLOSE RESULT-FILE
    STOP RUN.

1000-READ-CLAIM.
    READ CLAIM-FILE
        AT END
            SET AT-END-OF-CLAIMS TO TRUE
    END-READ.

2000-PROCESS-CLAIM.
    PERFORM 2100-INIT-RESULT
    PERFORM 2200-VALIDATE
    IF RECORD-IS-VALID
        PERFORM 3000-DETERMINE
    ELSE
        PERFORM 2300-REJECT
    END-IF
    PERFORM 9000-EMIT.

2100-INIT-RESULT.
    MOVE ZERO TO WS-STATUS WS-BASE WS-ALLOW WS-OFFSET WS-NET
    MOVE "0000000000" TO WS-TRACE
    MOVE SPACES TO CLAIM-REC
    MOVE "Y" TO WS-VALID.

2200-VALIDATE.
    IF WS-IN-LEN NOT = 80
        MOVE "N" TO WS-VALID
    ELSE
        MOVE CLAIM-LINE(1:80) TO CLAIM-REC
        IF CL-Q1-X IS NOT NUMERIC
            OR CL-Q2-X IS NOT NUMERIC
            OR CL-Q3-X IS NOT NUMERIC
            OR CL-Q4-X IS NOT NUMERIC
            OR CL-DEP-X IS NOT NUMERIC
            OR CL-AGE-X IS NOT NUMERIC
            OR CL-PEN-X IS NOT NUMERIC
            OR CL-SEV-X IS NOT NUMERIC
            MOVE "N" TO WS-VALID
        END-IF
        IF CL-RET NOT = "N" AND CL-RET NOT = "V" AND CL-RET NOT = "M"
            MOVE "N" TO WS-VALID
        END-IF
        IF CL-FLAG NOT = "Y" AND CL-FLAG NOT = "N"
            MOVE "N" TO WS-VALID
        END-IF
    END-IF.

2300-REJECT.
    MOVE 99 TO WS-STATUS
    MOVE "1" TO WS-TRACE(1:1).

3000-DETERMINE.
    PERFORM 3100-QUARTER-SHIFT
    PERFORM 3200-TOTAL-WAGES
    IF WS-TOTAL < MIN-WAGES
        MOVE 01 TO WS-STATUS
        MOVE "1" TO WS-TRACE(3:1)
    ELSE
        PERFORM 3300-COUNT-QUARTERS
        IF WS-QUARTERS < 2
            MOVE 02 TO WS-STATUS
            MOVE "1" TO WS-TRACE(4:1)
        ELSE
            PERFORM 4000-COMPUTE-BENEFIT
        END-IF
    END-IF.

3100-QUARTER-SHIFT.
    MOVE CL-Q4 TO WS-Q4-USED
    IF CL-FLAG = "Y"
        MOVE ZERO TO WS-Q4-USED
        MOVE "1" TO WS-TRACE(2:1)
    END-IF.

3200-TOTAL-WAGES.
    COMPUTE WS-TOTAL = CL-Q1 + CL-Q2 + CL-Q3 + WS-Q4-USED.

3300-COUNT-QUARTERS.
    MOVE ZERO TO WS-QUARTERS
    IF CL-Q1 > ZERO ADD 1 TO WS-QUARTERS END-IF
    IF CL-Q2 > ZERO ADD 1 TO WS-QUARTERS END-IF
    IF CL-Q3 > ZERO ADD 1 TO WS-QUARTERS END-IF
    IF WS-Q4-USED > ZERO ADD 1 TO WS-QUARTERS END-IF.

4000-COMPUTE-BENEFIT.
    MOVE ZERO TO WS-STATUS
    PERFORM 4100-BASE-BENEFIT
    PERFORM 4200-DEPENDENCY-ALLOWANCE
    PERFORM 4300-WAGE-CEILING
    PERFORM 4400-OFFSET
    PERFORM 4500-NET-PAYOUT.

4100-BASE-BENEFIT.
    MOVE CL-Q1 TO WS-HIGH
    IF CL-Q2 > WS-HIGH MOVE CL-Q2 TO WS-HIGH END-IF
    IF CL-Q3 > WS-HIGH MOVE CL-Q3 TO WS-HIGH END-IF
    IF WS-Q4-USED > WS-HIGH MOVE WS-Q4-USED TO WS-HIGH END-IF
    MOVE "1" TO WS-TRACE(5:1)
    COMPUTE WS-QUOTIENT = WS-HIGH / 26
    MOVE WS-QUOTIENT TO WS-BASE
    IF WS-QUOTIENT > 650
        MOVE CAP-BASE TO WS-BASE
        MOVE "1" TO WS-TRACE(6:1)
    END-IF.

4200-DEPENDENCY-ALLOWANCE.
    MOVE CL-DEP TO WS-DEPS-USED
    IF WS-DEPS-USED > 4
        MOVE 4 TO WS-DEPS-USED
    END-IF
    COMPUTE WS-ALLOW = ALLOW-PER-DEP * WS-DEPS-USED
    IF WS-ALLOW > ZERO
        MOVE "1" TO WS-TRACE(7:1)
    END-IF.

4300-WAGE-CEILING.
    COMPUTE WS-COMBINED = WS-BASE + WS-ALLOW
    COMPUTE WS-CEILING = 0.65 * WS-TOTAL / 52
    IF WS-COMBINED > WS-CEILING
        COMPUTE WS-COMBINED = WS-CEILING
        MOVE "1" TO WS-TRACE(8:1)
    END-IF.

4400-OFFSET.
    IF CL-AGE >= 62 AND CL-RET = "M"
        MOVE ZERO TO WS-OFFSET
        MOVE "1" TO WS-TRACE(10:1)
    ELSE
        COMPUTE WS-OFFSET = CL-PEN + CL-SEV * 0.50
        IF WS-OFFSET > ZERO
            MOVE "1" TO WS-TRACE(9:1)
        END-IF
    END-IF.

4500-NET-PAYOUT.
    COMPUTE WS-NET = WS-COMBINED - WS-OFFSET.

9000-EMIT.
    IF WS-STATUS = ZERO
        MOVE WS-BASE TO RS-BASE
        MOVE WS-ALLOW TO RS-ALLOW
        MOVE WS-OFFSET TO RS-OFFSET
        MOVE WS-NET TO RS-NET
    ELSE
        MOVE ZERO TO RS-BASE RS-ALLOW RS-OFFSET RS-NET
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-STATUS TO RS-STATUS
    MOVE WS-TRACE TO RS-TRACE
    MOVE RESULT-REC TO RESULT-LINE
    WRITE RESULT-LINE.
